      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#961;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>&#8467;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math>",
